abstract: "Public computational reproducibility materials for a VELE-based power-grid vulnerability-screening study using six IEEE/MATPOWER benchmark systems, structural and electrical outage analyses, executable MATPOWER 8.1/GNU Octave validation, and explicit topology-only limitations. The manuscript PDF/source and journal-submission files are intentionally excluded from the public reproducibility release."
keywords:
  - power systems
  - vulnerability screening
  - spectral graph theory
  - MATPOWER
  - DC power flow
  - reproducibility
